+/// The draft thread's tail reservation in blocks: charged with the pool by the runtime, so it comes
+/// off the schedulable count, never off the pool. Stated before the cache engine is built.
+static DRAFTER_RESERVED_BLOCKS: AtomicUsize = AtomicUsize::new(0);
